    "source": "// Cross-language ADT/Result fixture: a provider returns a user ADT (Found) and\n// a Result across the seam; a consumer requires the service so the probe can\n// call it through the proxy (the probe rides a driver that requires `dir`).\ntype Row = { id: Int, name: Str }\ntype Found = Hit(Row) | Missing\n\nservice Directory {\n  fn lookup(key: Str) -> Found\n  fn check(key: Str) -> Result[Row, Str]\n}\n\ncomponent DirSvc provides dir: Directory {\n  let store = effect Map.new() undo store.drop()\n  provide dir {\n    fn lookup(key) = Hit({ id: 1, name: key })\n    fn check(key) = Ok({ id: 1, name: key })\n  }\n}\n\ncomponent DirUser requires dir: Directory {\n  let scratch = effect Map.new() undo scratch.drop()\n}\n"
